  & =\\sqrt{{8}^{2}+{4}^{2}+(-4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{96} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,DMA$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{2}=2\\sqrt{6}.\n$$\n\nLet's also compute $MA$ since it appears in the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}MA & =|\\overset{\\to }{MA}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{12} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, using the formula ${A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}DH\\cdot MA,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{△} & =\\frac{1}{2}DH\\cdot MA \\\\ 2\\sqrt{6} & =\\frac{1}{2}DH\\cdot 2\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2\\sqrt{6} & =DH\\cdot \\sqrt{3} \\\\ DH & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ DH & =2\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315849 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315850 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315851 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315852 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315853 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1041 "selection" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315851 13194139534865 true] [17592186315848 1110 #uuid "ae163056-f4f5-500a-820c-0001434331df" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315849 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315849 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534865 true] [17592186315849 1111 #uuid "cbcd37eb-3e85-532d-8ace-b27877e3c091" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315850 1034 "6\\sqrt{2}" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315850 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534865 true] [17592186315850 1111 #uuid "2c24410e-7cef-5d73-b7ac-ea060d81da01" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315851 1034 "2\\sqrt{2}" 13194139534865 true] [17592186315851 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534865 true] [17592186315851 1111 #uuid "8de76152-263b-547